{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:44ba57bc3ead9728","name":"Adhesive Grenade","source":{"id":"source:reference-44ba57bc3ead9728","title":"Adhesive Grenade","revision":15711,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:04Z","sha256":"d5dcf2b984e1d74485b28dc1707958f5add78fb7ad59d47eda6a1888ee88c3e2","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15711","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Adhesive%20Grenade&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-44ba57bc3ead9728","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Designed as a method of riot control, the Adhesive Grenade explodes with an incredibly sticky substance that anchors a target to the ground and slowly dissolves so as not to trap targets for long periods of time. Any targets in the blast radius must succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check against the attacker's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," roll, or they will be unable to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"},". This effect lasts for 3 rounds, and once a character has broken free he or she need not make another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check to move through the blast radius.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Adhesive Grenades have a 2-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius and are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attacks"},". \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenades","referenceId":"reference:0288f85b407ca487"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," -\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," Radius:"]}," 2-Squares\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
